; first look smart mirror, an interactive, mirror-like touch display; smart catalogue, an innovative new SaaS based solution; BOXSIZE, a measurement solution for the package delivery market; and SIZEUP, a smart tape measure in the palm of your hand. It also provides Naiz Fit, AI-driven size and fit technology platform; and Orgad, an e-commerce retailer. The company was formerly known as Knowledgetree Ventures, Inc. and changed its name to My Size, Inc. in January 2014. My Size, Inc. was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Airport City, Israel."}}